{"title":"이미테이션","thumbnail":"https://dn-img-page.kakao.com/download/resource?kid=nzO09/hAd4bsrEMD/1IMqUTGbtMThYuxUzBezj0&filename=th3","synopsis":"\"나는 '진짜'를 꿈꿉니다.\"\n\n약육강식과도 같은 연예계. \n그곳에서 탑 솔로 가수 라리마와 닮은 이미지로\n반짝 인기를 끌었던 마하는 천우신조로 \n인기 방송 프로그램에 출연하는 기회를 얻게 된다.\n\n어떻게든 대중들에게 눈도장을 찍기 위해 \n최선을 다하지만 결과는 탑 아이돌 그룹 샥스의 멤버를 \n다치게 만드는 걸로 끝이 나고 마는데…\n\n그저 열심히 했던 것뿐인데, 왜 이렇게 돼버린 걸까?\n\n'진짜'를 꿈꾸는 별들의 이야기.\n\n<이미테이션>\n\n많은 관심 부탁드립니다.","topComments":[],"commentKeywords":[],"rankSeries":{"daily":[{"date":"2026-08-09","rank":114,"change":{"type":"down","amount":37}},{"date":"2026-08-10","rank":89,"change":{"type":"up","amount":25}},{"date":"2026-08-11","rank":77,"change":{"type":"up","amount":12}},{"date":"2026-08-12","rank":108,"change":{"type":"down","amount":31}},{"date":"2026-08-13","rank":124,"change":{"type":"down","amount":16}},{"date":"2026-08-14","rank":94,"change":{"type":"up","amount":30}},{"date":"2026-08-15","rank":107,"change":{"type":"down","amount":13}},{"date":"2026-08-16","rank":98,"change":{"type":"up","amount":9}},{"date":"2026-08-17","rank":98,"change":{"type":"same","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-18","rank":78,"change":{"type":"up","amount":20}},{"date":"2026-08-19","rank":101,"change":{"type":"down","amount":23}},{"date":"2026-08-20","rank":93,"change":{"type":"up","amount":8}},{"date":"2026-08-21","rank":68,"change":{"type":"up","amount":25}},{"date":"2026-08-22","rank":93,"change":{"type":"down","amount":25}},{"date":"2026-08-23","rank":107,"change":{"type":"down","amount":14}},{"date":"2026-08-24","rank":124,"change":{"type":"down","amount":17}},{"date":"2026-08-25","rank":115,"change":{"type":"up","amount":9}},{"date":"2026-08-26","rank":105,"change":{"type":"up","amount":10}},{"date":"2026-08-27","rank":120,"change":null},{"date":"2026-08-28","rank":115,"change":{"type":"up","amount":5}},{"date":"2026-08-29","rank":103,"change":{"type":"up","amount":12}},{"date":"2026-08-30","rank":105,"change":{"type":"down","amount":2}},{"date":"2026-08-31","rank